repository-code: "https://github.com/Sushan-Adhikari/AlgoRAG"
abstract: |
  AlgoRAG is a specialized retrieval-augmented generation system for theoretical
  computer science education. It combines DeepSeek V3 with a curated knowledge base
  of 847 lecture slides, 312 practice problems, and authoritative textbooks to deliver
  pedagogically sound explanations of algorithm analysis and complexity theory concepts.
  Our comprehensive evaluation on 179 exam-style questions demonstrates 100% success
  rate with high pedagogical quality (0.7620), providing step-by-step proofs,
  complexity analyses, and mathematical reasoning.
